      "content": "thanks but numbers on a phone arent gonna pay the mortgage or fix the fact that i've failed everyone. my family is gonna have to clean up my mess and i'll just be a burden forever. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasnt here to deal with the shame of it all. everything feels so heavy and pointless now.",
